  "actual_distinct_full_value_count": 6,
  "distinct_complete_values": {
    "dc5ee632282f6a2ce1fb912679906ae18e0ac52f9918032c529b4f1608dca1ff": "PBPS2609.06905v1 AppendixB B1-B5 exact macro identification/centering feeding C3-C4 and B15. Public actual canonical pullback range=P range and centered image equality; real new Test transports exact57 scalar contraction to all actual centered macro f and squared defect gap. Finite real Hilbert/Borel/rank0 explicit extension; trueL2 generally infinite dimensional. Public generic pullback range and actual PBPS range/mean/centered image; realTest-only allmacro contraction/squaredBgap. NoGamma/fullweakH1/B13/B14/dynamics/main/cost/composition/fullpaper/Goal claim.",
    "fe3d0629218e20c35114311717ec09fe09be6a27f9b275579a435f3156c66e7e": "Let E be a finite-dimensional real Hilbert Borel space with canonical volume, including rank zero as an explicit extension of the source Euclidean setting. Let V:E→ℝ be C2, 0<α≤β, and α‖v‖²≤D²V(x)[v,v]≤β‖v‖² for all x,v. Let η>0 and βη≤1. Set μ=volume.tilted(−V), J=Law(X,X+√ηZ) for independent X∼μ,Z∼N(0,I), ν=J.snd. Let P be the actual conditional-expectation orthogonal projection onto the second-coordinate sigma algebra in L²(J). There exists one linear isometry U:L²(J)→L²(J) whose AE representative is composition with F(x,y)=(x,2x−y), with U²=I and U self-adjoint. Define A=PUP and B=(I−P)UP. For every f∈ran P with ∫f dJ=0, ‖Af‖≤[(1−αη)/(1+αη)]‖f‖ and [4αη/(1+αη)²]‖f‖²≤‖Bf‖². This includes αη=1, uses the actual, potentially infinite-dimensional L²(J), without imposing finite-dimensionality on L², and is Test-level integration of already produced operators; Γ, its inverse and trajectories are not asserted.",
    "0d1a5f5f7b23ad81d78aae7016680cab89ed3656d51df361854fa9b66457d3cc": "Let E be a finite-dimensional real Hilbert Borel space with canonical volume, including rank zero as an explicit extension of the source Euclidean setting. Let V:E→ℝ be C2, 0<α≤β, and α‖v‖²≤D²V(x)[v,v]≤β‖v‖² for all x,v. Let η>0 and βη≤1. Set μ=volume.tilted(−V), J=Law(X,X+√ηZ) for independent X∼μ,Z∼N(0,I), ν=J.snd. Let P be the actual conditional-expectation orthogonal projection onto the second-coordinate sigma algebra in L²(J). There exists one linear isometry U:L²(J)→L²(J) whose AE representative is composition with F(x,y)=(x,2x−y), with U²=I and U self-adjoint. Define A=PUP and B=(I−P)UP. For every f∈ran P with ∫f dJ=0, ‖Af‖≤[(1−αη)/(1+αη)]‖f‖ and [4αη/(1+αη)²]‖f‖²≤‖Bf‖². This includes αη=1, uses actual infinite-dimensional L²(J), and is Test-level integration of already produced operators; Γ, its inverse and trajectories are not asserted.",
    "be3a4f16e3f8f9dfc4d234d1a884ea302167c83b22bd8b69e1dfc31b5e16ac99": "Attributed ASTIS-authored scoped mathematical restatement/completion.\nLet X,Y be arbitrary measurable spaces, μ,ν arbitrary measures and f:X→Y measure preserving (measurable and f₊μ=ν). Let M_f:L²(ν;ℝ)→L²(μ;ℝ) be canonical isometric pullback. Then its range is exactly the submodule of L²(μ;ℝ) classes having an AE strongly measurable representative for the comap sigma algebra f⁻¹ΣY. There is no probability, finite-measure, standard-Borel or finite-dimensional hypothesis.\nExact source boundary: PBPS2609.06905v1 AppendixB B1-B5 exact macro identification/centering feeding C3-C4 and B15. Public actual canonical pullback range=P range and centered image equality; real new Test transports exact57 scalar contraction to all actual centered macro f and squared defect gap.\nRemaining: PBPS2609.06905v1 AppendixB B1-B5 exact macro identification/centering feeding C3-C4 and B15. Public actual canonical pullback range=P range and centered image equality; real new Test transports exact57 scalar contraction to all actual centered macro f and squared defect gap. Finite real Hilbert/Borel/rank0 explicit extension; trueL2 generally infinite dimensional. Public generic pullback range and actual PBPS range/mean/centered image; realTest-only allmacro contraction/squaredBgap. NoGamma/fullweakH1/B13/B14/dynamics/main/cost/composition/fullpaper/Goal claim.",
    "2172bfcd2370872bf0bbb51a87d8d7c785186e014697a9fbdc34720d1c6c9a37": "Attributed ASTIS-authored scoped mathematical restatement/completion.\nLet E be a finite-dimensional real Hilbert Borel space with canonical volume, including rank zero as an explicit extension of the source Euclidean setting. Let V:E→ℝ be C2, 0<α≤β, and α‖v‖²≤D²V(x)[v,v]≤β‖v‖² for all x,v. Let η>0 and βη≤1. Set μ=volume.tilted(−V), J=Law(X,X+√ηZ) for independent X∼μ,Z∼N(0,I), ν=J.snd. Let P be the actual conditional-expectation orthogonal projection onto the second-coordinate sigma algebra in L²(J). For the canonical isometric pullback M u(x,y)=u(y), both J and ν are probabilities, ran M=ran P, and ∫Mu dJ=∫u dν for every u∈L²(ν). Consequently M maps the full zero-mean subspace of L²(ν) onto exactly {f∈ran P:∫f dJ=0}. No caller onto, centering, probability or law certificate is assumed.\nExact source boundary: PBPS2609.06905v1 AppendixB B1-B5 exact macro identification/centering feeding C3-C4 and B15. Public actual canonical pullback range=P range and centered image equality; real new Test transports exact57 scalar contraction to all actual centered macro f and squared defect gap.\nRemaining: PBPS2609.06905v1 AppendixB B1-B5 exact macro identification/centering feeding C3-C4 and B15. Public actual canonical pullback range=P range and centered image equality; real new Test transports exact57 scalar contraction to all actual centered macro f and squared defect gap. Finite real Hilbert/Borel/rank0 explicit extension; trueL2 generally infinite dimensional. Public generic pullback range and actual PBPS range/mean/centered image; realTest-only allmacro contraction/squaredBgap. NoGamma/fullweakH1/B13/B14/dynamics/main/cost/composition/fullpaper/Goal claim.",
    "91d560a13c9419ab58ec8de98841ceeb0247d5ad6ae3bc38d67da118faa9a27c": "Attributed ASTIS-authored scoped mathematical restatement/completion.\nLet E be a finite-dimensional real Hilbert Borel space with canonical volume, including rank zero as an explicit extension of the source Euclidean setting. Let V:E→ℝ be C2, 0<α≤β, and α‖v‖²≤D²V(x)[v,v]≤β‖v‖² for all x,v. Let η>0 and βη≤1. Set μ=volume.tilted(−V), J=Law(X,X+√ηZ) for independent X∼μ,Z∼N(0,I), ν=J.snd. Let P be the actual conditional-expectation orthogonal projection onto the second-coordinate sigma algebra in L²(J). There exists one linear isometry U:L²(J)→L²(J) whose AE representative is composition with F(x,y)=(x,2x−y), with U²=I and U self-adjoint. Define A=PUP and B=(I−P)UP. For every f∈ran P with ∫f dJ=0, ‖Af‖≤[(1−αη)/(1+αη)]‖f‖ and [4αη/(1+αη)²]‖f‖²≤‖Bf‖². This includes αη=1, uses the actual, potentially infinite-dimensional L²(J), without imposing finite-dimensionality on L², and is Test-level integration of already produced operators; Γ, its inverse and trajectories are not asserted.\nExact source boundary: PBPS2609.06905v1 AppendixB B1-B5 exact macro identification/centering feeding C3-C4 and B15. Public actual canonical pullback range=P range and centered image equality; real new Test transports exact57 scalar contraction to all actual centered macro f and squared defect gap.\nRemaining: PBPS2609.06905v1 AppendixB B1-B5 exact macro identification/centering feeding C3-C4 and B15. Public actual canonical pullback range=P range and centered image equality; real new Test transports exact57 scalar contraction to all actual centered macro f and squared defect gap. Finite real Hilbert/Borel/rank0 explicit extension; trueL2 generally infinite dimensional. Public generic pullback range and actual PBPS range/mean/centered image; realTest-only allmacro contraction/squaredBgap. NoGamma/fullweakH1/B13/B14/dynamics/main/cost/composition/fullpaper/Goal claim."
  },
